      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. NICKO (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Maitland over 565m (31.97). Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has good early burn and is drawn to be prominent. Has ability and can bounce back. OPAWA GABBY (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (20.94) at Nowra behind Opo Ninja in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Hard to beat again. ZIPPING DOWNEY (1) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (30.61) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Nowra. Can turn it around this time. HOUDINI ESCAPE (3) was out of placings last time (18.00) at Richmond Straight in a NG, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Has already won two times from this draw.",
